    {
      "uid": "zhcn:566791c2dbeb24391521603c",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "奇锐骏渴望成为主角。\n她想要跑得比谁都还要快。",
      "source_fingerprint": "18c8846f8ee9d2a19afc53a5f7b7bca2b0a5b83bfae8fcb9f7c105f9ced30ff6",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1100/storytimeline_501100115.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        60,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/60/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b91cd489d78aab0835ec32c3",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "准备时间根本不够。\n毕竟她和醒目飞鹰的实力差距还很大。\n",
      "source_fingerprint": "c9c3c1399f57ac0ae447163147b1661425305a0d0460cf41762996e7e839f7bf",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1100/storytimeline_501100115.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        61,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/61/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:41e8d40ec48f12aea430ae9c",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "要确实提升到能够和她拼输赢的水准，\n光凭现在的训练计划还是……\n",
      "source_fingerprint": "5554188e8e9d9297345664939ddc91a93163e3d1368cd6396ad69f7d31a1f5eb",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1100/storytimeline_501100115.json",
      "json_path": [
