      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "将望眼欲穿的心愿……即刻累积起来。\n如果活得久又活得好，\n是一种“智慧”的话……",
      "source_fingerprint": "71ddd94914a43fdc304edc2a86e26c9f55ba1a4c314e06c2798fb4831c5a7484",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
